x617 "editing"
x618 puts x616 x617
x619 open x618 11
x620 write x619 2
x621 "Views and edits"
x622 puts x620 x621
x623 close x622
x624 open x623 2
x625 write x624 2
x626 "A model never sees a whole file. It asks for a view of one function: the function with a handle line on top (e0), one signature line per callee, and a program handle (g0). The program view is scoped to the target, its transitive callees and its direct callers, so it stays the same size as the program grows. The revision is a short hash of the program text; an edit written against an older revision is rejected rather than applied to code that has moved. A reply is the handle line followed by edits, one per line, as in the quick start."
x627 puts x625 x626
x628 close x627
x629 open x628 10
x630 write x629 4
x631 write x630 2
