x643 close x642
x644 write x643 2
x645 "e0 fn clamp u32 u32 u32 -> u32\nlo lt p0 p1\nhi lt p2 p0\na select lo p1 p0\nr select hi p2 a\nret r\n\n"
x646 puts x644 x645
x647 open x646 6
x648 write x647 4
x649 write x648 2
x650 "cm"
x651 puts x649 x650
x652 write x651 2
x653 "# reply\n"
x654 puts x652 x653
x655 close x654
x656 write x655 2
x657 "e0\nhi lt p2 a\nr select hi p2 a"
x658 puts x656 x657
x659 close x658
x660 close x659
x661 close x660
x662 open x661 13
x663 write x662 4
x664 write x663 1
x665 "diagnostics"
x666 puts x664 x665
x667 open x666 11
x668 write x667 2
x669 "Diagnostics"
x670 puts x668 x669
x671 close x670
x672 open x671 2
x673 write x672 2
x674 "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: an ambiguous reply is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x675 puts x673 x674
x676 close x675
x677 close x676

